From f8a12ea2dc402b6533ff594fda6af26e2d14fbce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: No <No@ty.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 20:05:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(tts): connection test button and model picker for
 OpenAI-compatible TTS

Settings -> Text-to-Speech gains a Model dropdown and a Test button in
the OpenAI-Compatible TTS section. Test saves the current fields, health
checks the server, and reports reachability plus the available voice
count inline; on success the model list is refreshed from GET /v1/models
(falling back to tts-1/tts-1-hd) and an invalid saved model snaps to the
server's first. The selected model is persisted as openaiTtsModel and
used in speech payloads (cache keys already include the model).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
